# Kurn, Son of Mogh (2/3): Deathtouch (CR 702.2a) destroys the blocking Acridian (2/4) though Kurn deals only 2, while
# Kurn survives the 2 back. Kurn attacks Bot2 alone, so X is 1: Bot1 draws one and loses 1 (at 19). Without deathtouch
# the 2/4 would live; unblocked Bot2 would fall to 18 instead of staying at 20.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Kurn, Son of Mogh
Island x4
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Acridian
Island x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Kurn, Son of Mogh.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Acridian.Cast
? Bot2.Mana =
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Kurn, Son of Mogh > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.DeclareBlockers]
Bot2.Block(Acridian > Kurn, Son of Mogh)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 19
Bot2.Life = 20
Bot2.Graveyard = Acridian
Bot1.Graveyard = Black Lotus
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 2
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
Bot1.Library.Count = 11
Bot2.Library.Count = 12
